        <slugline>CHILE-LITHIUM</slugline>
        <headline>Chilean lawmakers approve lithium royalty bill</headline>
        <description role="drol:summary">Lower house passes bill raising royalties on lithium producers.</description>
      </contentMeta>
      <contentSet>
        <inlineXML contenttype="application/xhtml+xml">
          <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <head><title>CHILE-LITHIUM</title></head>
            <body>
              <p>
                Chile's lower house of Congress approved a bill on Tuesday that would raise royalties paid by lithium producers on a sliding scale linked to prices, sending it to the Senate.
              </p>
              <p>
                Supporters said the measure would fund regional development, while mining groups warned it could deter investment in new brine projects.
              </p>
